      "cites": ["E6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The listed reason is a business decision to discontinue manufacture of the drug.",
      "cites": ["E6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General currently holds 64 units with a daily use of 2.9, providing 22 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The Northstar Rx LLC label (NDC 16714013101) names Gland Pharma Limited (FEI 3009056604) as the registered plant for analysis and manufacture, with a last inspection classification of NAI on 2023-07-28.",
      "cites": ["E5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection history for Gland Pharma Limited (FEI 3009056604) shows VAI classifications on 2013-08-05, 2015-06-30, and 2019-11-01.",
      "cites": ["E2", "E3", "E4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The recommended option is to buy from Actavis Pharma, Inc., which is not on FDA's shortage list today, though its label names no plant we could place.",
